  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Valero Marketing and Supply has $483M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date across 98 awards with an average award size of $4.9M. Valero Marketing and Supply's current-year obligations are down 59.1% compared with the prior year. Annual obligations peaked earlier in the decade, reaching $1.4B in FY22, and have since trended lower through FY25 before the FY2026 to date total. Valero Marketing and Supply recorded $513M in FY21, $1.4B in FY22, $1.2B in FY23, $1.1B in FY24, and $1.2B in FY25. The FY2026 to date figure of $483M is a partial-year total and represents the company's current federal spending level for the fiscal year so far. These figures reflect contract obligations, except where specifically noted as award-value totals in other tables on the vendor page.",
